OL,3,GNEWSA'Starring in Pressure with
OL,4,AHollywood stars was amazing'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was in a room full of these amazing
OL,7,Factors - it was the most amazing,
OL,8,Famazing experience," says Roseanna
OL,9,FBrown about her starring role in the
OL,10,Flatest Hollywood drama, Pressure.
OL,12,FThe British-Irish actress and singer,
OL,13,Fwho grew up in Windsor, Berkshire,
OL,14,Fplays the lead operator in US president
OL,15,FDwight Eisenhower's team in the film -
OL,16,Fa World War Two drama about the tough
OL,17,Fchoices made in the 72 hours before
OL,18,FD-Day.
