OL,3,GNEWSA'Starring in Pressure with
OL,4,AHollywood stars was amazing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCast alongside stars including Brendan
OL,7,FFraser, Andrew Scott and Damien Lewis,
OL,8,Fit is her biggest role to date, having
OL,9,Fpreviously portrayed a Slytherin
OL,10,Fstudent in the Harry Potter series and
OL,11,FFandral's Wench in Thor: The Dark
OL,12,FWorld.
OL,14,FAhead of the film's release in UK
OL,15,Fcinemas on 9 September, Brown shares
OL,16,Fhow much she learned from the filming
OL,17,Fand her dreams about future roles.
